# Documentation Discipline

Treat `Documentation/` as maintained source of truth. Keep confirmed requirements, assumptions, and open questions clearly separated.

**Always (when applicable):**
- Status/scope change → update `Documentation/feature-tracker.md`
- Binding decision or new open question → update `Documentation/decision-log.md`

**Delivery work:** requirements live in signed artifacts under `Documentation/delivery/` — do not mirror per-feature into `product-requirements.md`. Update the PRD only when product scope or vision changes.

**Visual work:** `Documentation/style-guide/` + `Documentation/page-guides/` (not faux-TDD).
